# NAME: GPT (Merged: blackmatrix7 + 水獭 + 官方网络依赖补充)
# FORMAT: Rule-Set (.list / Mihomo format: text / Surge / Shadowrocket / Loon)
# REVIEWED: 2026-11-26

# ==================== 核心服务与 API ====================
# 包含登录、API、WebSocket、桌面端与移动端的相关子域名
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai
DOMAIN,openaicom-api-bdcpf8c6d2e9atf6.z01.azurefd.net

# ==================== 静态资源、CDN 与云存储 ====================
# 旧 CDN 地址保留为兼容项，当前实际用途未逐一确认
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openaiapi-site.azureedge.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openaicom.imgix.net
DOMAIN,cdn.openaimerge.com
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN,openaicomproductionae4b.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN,production-openaicom-storage.azureedge.net

# ==================== 语音与实时通信 (LiveKit) ====================
# host / turn 为共享基础设施
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,host.livekit.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,turn.livekit.cloud

# ==================== 身份认证、证书与人机验证 ====================
# 防 IP 不一致触发风控，含 Arkose / Auth0 / IdenTrust
DOMAIN,openai-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,client-api.arkoselabs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,auth0.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,identrust.com

# ==================== 特性开关、遥测与错误监控 ====================
# 含 Statsig / LaunchDarkly / Sentry / Segment / Datadog / Cloudflare Insights / oaistatsig
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigapi.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.statsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,featuregates.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,launchdarkly.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,segment.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,observeit.net
DOMAIN,static.cloudflareinsights.com
# DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
# DOMAIN,rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,datadog

# ==================== 支付、搜索与客服依赖 ====================
# 含 Stripe / Intercom / Algolia，若不希望影响其他网站可按需注释
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stripe.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,algolia.net

# ==================== 桌面端本地进程 ====================
# 需要客户端支持进程识别，且名称与实际进程一致
PROCESS-NAME-WILDCARD,ChatGPT*
PROCESS-NAME-WILDCARD,Codex*

# ==================== IP 与 ASN 兼容项 ====================
# 两个固定 IP 的当前 OpenAI 用途未确认，按兼容原则保留
# AS20473 属于 Vultr，会覆盖其网络内的其他业务
# no-resolve 避免这些规则主动触发目标域名解析
IP-CIDR,24.199.123.28/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,64.23.132.171/32,no-resolve
IP-ASN,20473,no-resolve
